#: ../../tools/proteomexchange_tools.rst:32 0ddebdcae2424ae886a84a01e6a04ae1
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get detailed metadata for a ProteomeXchange proteomics "
"dataset by PX identifier. Returns title, species, instruments, "
"publications (PubMed/DOI), file count, and cross-references to partner "
"repositories (PRIDE, MassIVE, PeptideAtlas, jPOST). ProteomeXchange is "
"the central hub for proteomics data sharing. Example: PXD000001 returns "
"the first ProteomeXchange dataset (Erwinia carotovora TMT LC-MS/MS from "
"Cambridge)."
msgstr ""

