"MassIVE PROXI interface. Returns dataset accessions, titles, and species."
" ProteomeXchange aggregates data from PRIDE, MassIVE, PeptideAtlas, "
"jPOST, and iProX. Useful for finding proteomics studies related to "
"specific organisms, diseases, or proteins."
